        "subject": "LU-17429 tests: sanity-quota/48 file needs proj=10000",
        "message": "LU-17429 tests: sanity-quota/48 file needs proj=10000\n\nThe sanity-quota test_48 file needs to explicitly set project ID\nto 10000 as required by the test case, to avoid depending on a\nprevious test having used this QID.\n\nAllow a delay for the QID to be added/removed from visibility.\nImprove code style to allow test file to be created on any OST.\nReplace direct /proc file access with \"lctl get_param\".\n\nLustre-change: https://review.whamcloud.com/59951\nLustre-commit: fd02709c187e9059383c81892594ded0e925d786\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: 78be823f33 (\"LU-15218 quota: delete unused quota ID\")\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I3bf5700ee4209dc31fab13554f6ef96614cdb1ea\nReviewed-by: Sergey Cheremencev <scherementsev@ddn.com>\nReviewed-by: Hongchao Zhang <hongchao@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Frederick Dilger <fdilger@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
